<view class="page"><view class="vi-brand-row"><image class="vi-corporate-logo" src="/assets/brand/betech-logo-orange.png" mode="aspectFit"/><text>Beline Home</text></view><view class="eyebrow">DEVICE ONBOARDING</view><view class="h1">设备安装与验收</view><view class="muted">{{tenant.name}} · 管家工作台</view><view class="notice">本地模拟，不扫描真实设备，不调用 TTLock。正式型号和联网能力需确认。</view>
<view class="row section"><text>步骤 {{step}} / 4</text><text>{{step===1?'登记设备':step===2?'安装联调':step===3?'确认验收':'投入使用'}}</text></view>
<block wx:if="{{step===1}}"><view class="field"><text>设备类型</text><picker range="{{types}}" value="{{typeIndex}}" bindchange="type"><view class="select">{{form.type}}</view></picker></view><view class="field"><text>绑定房间</text><picker range="{{rooms}}" range-key="selectorText" value="{{roomIndex}}" bindchange="room"><view class="select">{{rooms[roomIndex].selectorText}}</view></picker></view><view class="field"><text>设备编号（6–40位）</text><input value="{{form.serial}}" data-field="serial" bindinput="input" maxlength="40" placeholder="输入编号或模拟扫描"/></view><view class="row"><button class="smallbtn" bindtap="scan">模拟扫描编号</button><button class="smallbtn" bindtap="addRoom">添加演示房间</button></view><view class="muted">每间房每类设备只可绑定一台。已有设备或安装任务时会阻止重复登记。</view></block>
<block wx:if="{{step===2}}"><view class="card"><view class="strong">{{rooms[roomIndex].selectorText}} · {{form.type}}</view><view class="sub">{{form.serial}}</view><view class="divider"></view><view class="muted">{{form.type==='门锁'?'1. 安装门锁，确认复位与蓝牙权限。\n2. 模拟蓝牙初始化和云端登记。\n3. 检查网关与远程操作回执。':'1. 由合格人员安装表计并检查安全。\n2. 核对通信配置与安装底数。\n3. 模拟首次读数与控制回执。'}}</view></view><checkbox-group bindchange="prepared"><label><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{form.prepared}}" color="#ff5100"/>确认安装和安全准备完成（演示）</label></checkbox-group><view class="field"><text>联网方式</text><picker range="{{networks}}" value="{{networkIndex}}" bindchange="network"><view class="select">{{form.network}}</view></picker></view><view class="field" wx:if="{{needsGateway}}"><text>关联项目网关</text><picker range="{{gateways}}" range-key="name" value="{{gatewayIndex}}" bindchange="gateway"><view class="select">{{gateways[gatewayIndex].name || '请先在 Web 添加本项目网关'}}</view></picker></view><view class="field" wx:if="{{form.type!=='门锁'}}"><text>安装底数（{{form.type==='电表'?'kWh':'m³'}}）</text><input type="digit" value="{{form.baseline}}" data-field="baseline" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="field"><text>模拟联调结果</text><picker range="{{results}}" value="{{resultIndex}}" bindchange="result"><view class="select">{{results[resultIndex]}}</view></picker></view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{install.status==='failed'}}">联调失败，设备尚未投用。请检查电源、网络和设备归属，切换成功结果后重试。</view></block>
<block wx:if="{{step===3}}"><view class="card"><view class="strong">联调通过，等待验收</view><view class="sub">{{form.type}} · {{form.serial}}</view><view class="divider"></view><view class="row" wx:for="{{install.checks}}" wx:key="label"><text>{{item.label}}</text><text>通过</text></view><view class="muted">{{form.network}} · {{form.type==='门锁'?'验收后单独发放权限':'安装底数 '+install.baseline}}</view></view><checkbox-group bindchange="accepted"><label><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{form.accepted}}" color="#ff5100"/>确认位置、设备编号及测试结果，完成演示验收</label></checkbox-group></block>
<block wx:if="{{step===4}}"><view class="card"><view class="h1">已验收并投用（模拟）</view><view class="strong">{{rooms[roomIndex].selectorText}} · {{form.type}}</view><view class="muted">{{form.serial}}</view><view class="notice">{{form.type==='门锁'?'可继续模拟开门、办理入住或临时授权。安装不会自动发放住户钥匙。':'安装底数已保存，可同步抄表；水电读数齐全后按账期出账，不自动扣费。'}}</view></view><button class="primary wide" bindtap="operate">设备模拟操作</button><button class="wide" bindtap="newInstall">继续新增设备</button></block>
<button wx:if="{{step<4}}" class="primary wide" bindtap="next">{{step===1?'登记并开始安装':step===2?'运行模拟联调':'确认验收并绑定'}}</button><button wx:if="{{install && step<4}}" class="wide" bindtap="cancel">取消安装任务</button><view class="section">安装任务与验收记录</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{jobs}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="resume"><view class="row"><view class="strong">{{item.roomText}} · {{item.type}}</view><text class="pill">{{item.statusText}}</text></view><view class="sub">{{item.serial}} · 点击继续 / 查看</view></view></view>
